      "statement": "AbstractTLRControllerTest and its per-family subclasses pin this flow against a real Redis (redis:7.0-alpine Testcontainers container): get-result while the run is in flight answers not-ready with no Redis key existing yet, wait-for-result polls until the key exists, re-POSTing the start endpoints after completion is served from the database, and both start endpoints reject empty uploads before any ArDoCo work.",
